{"parse": {"title": "晃铃响于山谷-02", "pageid": 89641, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%99%83%E9%93%83%E5%93%8D%E4%BA%8E%E5%B1%B1%E8%B0%B7-01\" title=\"晃铃响于山谷-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">晃铃响于山谷-02</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%99%83%E9%93%83%E5%93%8D%E4%BA%8E%E5%B1%B1%E8%B0%B7-03\" title=\"晃铃响于山谷-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">晃铃响于山谷</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">02</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.89.87.E7.93.A6.E6.97.A0.E5.AD.98\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"片瓦无存\">片瓦无存</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 片瓦无存</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Reduced to Ashes</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item selected\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>序幕</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>父亲</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"3\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>母亲</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"4\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>库玛尔</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"5\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>落幕</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-zongmaolaozhaitingyuan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"zongmaolaozhaitingyuan\"><img alt=\"zongmaolaozhaitingyuan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/Cg-zongmaolaozhaitingyuan.png/600px-Cg-zongmaolaozhaitingyuan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/Cg-zongmaolaozhaitingyuan.png/900px-Cg-zongmaolaozhaitingyuan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/Cg-zongmaolaozhaitingyuan.png/1200px-Cg-zongmaolaozhaitingyuan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他隐约听见女人在无助地哭喊，颤抖着声带，这声音似曾相识……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>木头焚烧的气味蹿入鼻腔，他的耳边噼啪作响……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>又是这里……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>火焰汹汹燎起，吞噬着眼前的屋子，无数黑色碎屑在眼前飘散。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他站在焰尖下摇摇欲坠的老宅前，阴影盖住他的脸，窒息感如同火焰燃起的昨日。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>我不会再上当……我就站在这，等着你烧成灰烬，什么也不留下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>呜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“如果这是真实的呢？”有声音向他窃窃私语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>是那道声音，他曾在惊惶中向它献上了自己的左臂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>摩卢旁卡因此幸免于难，但世上从此再无那个强大的沙尔玛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“你还能做出选择……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老宅内的木门崩塌，星火溅射在他的脸上，疼痛、炙热，又由眼泪浇灭。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>汗水在他脏兮兮的脸庞划下几道清晰的痕迹。他攥紧拳头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“这或许是最后一次机会，你知道的。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“你妄图抛开、遗忘一切，用肉体的痛苦自我麻痹，无济于事的反问每天都在你的脑子里萦绕。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“但真的，无济于事了吗？”</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他曾对家族不屑一顾，罔顾肩负的使命，荒废卓绝的天赋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>神秘学家与人类共存的伊甸园，没有高下之分的生活，那才应是众人所追寻的未来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……在这之前，他从未动摇过这个信念。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>父亲……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>折了腿的男人，扶着桌子坐在地上，背靠着墙面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>燃烧的断木轰然落下，将咫尺外的桌子砸了个稀巴烂。而男人无动于衷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"613110.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-613110.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-613110.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"613110.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-613110.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-613110.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-613110.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-613110.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库鲁：</div><div>卡皮尔，你这个蠢蛋！这跟说好的不一样，瞧瞧这火，都要烧到咱们家了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡皮尔：</div><div>我，我不知道，不是要把瓶子都丢出去吗……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"613110.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-613110.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-613110.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"613110.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-613110.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-613110.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-613110.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-613110.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库鲁：</div><div>该死的，那帮家伙没告诉咱这些！算了，先跑……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们站在大门前，仿佛这只是一场出了意外的马戏表演。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“这就是你所信任的人类朋友，好孩子。”——脑内响起的，是父亲的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>愧疚与悲痛早在时光中沉寂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>唯有仇恨仍旧鲜明。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他走过去，像在以往的梦境中做过的那样——试图搀扶起地上稍显苍老的男人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-614301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-614301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-614301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">父亲：</div><div>这里不需要你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一如既往的拒绝。记忆中的威容与尊颜并没随着他的死亡而变得模糊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-614301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-614301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-614301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">父亲：</div><div>你已经不是沙尔玛的一员了……松开你的手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>……父亲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-614301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-614301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-614301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">父亲：</div><div>……我、你的母亲，整个家族曾对你倾注无数心血……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-614301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-614301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-614301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">父亲：</div><div>而你辜负了一切——你已经没有资格涉足家族的任何抉择。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在此之前，即便他与家族已经决裂，他们也从未怀疑过，只把他当作是一位离经叛道的孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-614301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-614301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-614301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">父亲：</div><div>你以为，我们不愿与人类往来，只是因为固执已见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-614301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-614301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-614301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">父亲：</div><div>你以为，我们将那些人类拒之门外，是因为守着这三分地，诚惶诚恐，害怕失去所谓的尊严。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-614301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-614301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-614301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">父亲：</div><div>普什亚，人类的友谊蒙蔽了你，而我们数次宽容了你作为孩子的无知。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-614301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-614301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-614301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">父亲：</div><div>我们始终期望你能回头，明白这一切并非那么简单——明白这不是你一人便可弥合的罅隙……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他摇摇头，连最后一点气力也用尽了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>喉间生涩，响起的仍是那些没有传达到的话语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>我……可以把一切交还给你。只要大家都能从这里逃出……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“啪！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-614301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-614301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-614301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">父亲：</div><div>出去！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“呲。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无需抬头，断裂的横梁坠下，划过眼前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>地面上鲜血流淌，一如那日之后，反复在梦魇中出现的景象。</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"3\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>主厅成了一片火海，耳边响起女人的祈祷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这声音无比熟悉。她的摇篮曲曾伴你度过了童年每一个受到责罚的夜晚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>踹开锁住的房门。仆人已倒在地上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>快起来，妈妈！我可以把你背出去……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-614201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-614201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-614201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"131\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div>“白象将眷顾你的灵魂，它会将你安放于温暖的床榻，你将获得永恒的平静……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她紧握着仆人的手，赐予他最后的安宁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-614201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-614201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-614201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"131\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div>巴哈特在后院发现纵火的人类，打算拦住他们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-614201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-614201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-614201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"131\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div>但他们有备而来——那些燃烧瓶和武器是特制的。一定是那群人指使的……这些东西人类本无法接触。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>他们是谁？！妈妈，告诉我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>母亲阖上双眼，摇了摇头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>仆人的脖颈处，鲜血止不住地迸出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-614201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-614201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-614201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"131\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div>……巴哈特一直告诉我，这并非你的过错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-614201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-614201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-614201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"131\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div>我说我知道，我明白，你一直都是很好的孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>血浸红了她瘦弱苍白的手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>对不起，对不起……我，我不知道他们会这么做。没有任何……他们没跟我说过……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但母亲不再言语。无论他用多大的力量，她的身躯始终屹然不动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他环顾四周，找寻熄灭火焰的方法。回过头，庭院之中，一个身影屹立。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他不可置信，踉跄着向身影走去。</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"4\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>燃烧的菩提树、轰然倒塌的房屋……她愉悦地看着一切，像是一种享受。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>姐，姐姐？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>你怎么会在这里？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>噢，现在你知道了……还叫得这样亲切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>——我想起来，那会儿你……只有这么高。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她伸出手，在腿侧随意地比划了一下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>……什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>宅子的大门在我眼前阖上的那天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>——嗯……这棵菩提树以前有这么高吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>……我为什么出现在这里，你应当最清楚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>你明知道这事儿与我无关——但你觉得我会享受这个，所以你让我钻进你的脑袋里欣赏下……不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>唔……挺好，你倒是了解我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她抚摸焦黑的表皮，对一切无动于衷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库玛尔：</div><div>不要用那样的目光望着我——他们只希望被你搭救。我只是一个微不足道……用着蹩脚的神秘术的外人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的话音刚落，烈焰爆燃而起，老宅的最后一根柱子也被火焰吞噬殆尽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>……！？</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"5\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“你又来到这了。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>空无一物，薄雾弥漫，这是一个纯白无暇的空间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>这是……在哪？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“这不重要。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>你又把我拖进噩梦里了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“是你的灵魂一直渴望返回。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一头白色巨象从薄雾中浮现，它伫立在他眼前，庄严而肃穆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>是你……！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>除了手臂，你还要拿走我的什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-614801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鬃毛沙砾：</div><div>——尽管来拿吧！除了这副身体，我没有什么能再交予你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它的身影缓缓隐去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>…………</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "晃铃响于山谷-02"}}